\[  \mathcal{G}(x;\xi) = \gamma^{-1} \left( x - \prox_{\gamma g(\cdot,\xi)}(x - \gamma {\nabla} f(x,\xi)) \right). \]
Then, it follows immediately that  the previous stochastic proximal
